The control plane (worker/src/core, worker/src/orb, worker/src/registry.ts) is
forked from cf-orbs, Copyright 2026 Meir Dick, Apache-2.0:
https://github.com/meirdick/cf-orbs

cf-orbs includes patterns adapted from cloudflare/sandbox-sdk (Apache-2.0,
https://github.com/cloudflare/sandbox-sdk): the setsid + boot_id background
process guard, the per-object exclusive operation queue, and the auto-save
alarm loop.

The plugin shape follows e2b-dev/opencode-e2b (Apache-2.0,
https://github.com/e2b-dev/opencode-e2b). No E2B code is copied.

